WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.456
The sun warms water, and some water evaporates into

00:00:03.456 --> 00:00:04.220
the air.

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:07.986
As the air cools, water vapor forms tiny drops. These

00:00:07.986 --> 00:00:09.548
drops form clouds.

00:00:09.598 --> 00:00:12.649
When the drops grow large enough, rain falls to the

00:00:12.649 --> 00:00:14.624
ground. The cycle continues.
